		(property "Description" "WIDENED local copy of cec-ent-power:ADS7830IPWR (pin offsets doubled to +/-20.32mm, body to +/-15.24mm) so the REFIN_REFOUT pin name clears the opposing CH6 name at 05c-detect-adc's 8-channel density (standard S6). 8-bit, 8-channel (4 differential/8 single-ended) sampling ADC w/ I2C interface, 70kHz max, built-in 2.5V ref/buffer. TSSOP-16 (PW). Candidate PolarFire-adjacent analog-read path for DETECT x8 / rail-sense x4 / RJ-11 loop / eFuse IMON (PolarFire SoC has no on-die ADC, verified DS00004248E) — flagged NOT YET RATIFIED, owner/firmware call per bom-c-module-if-base-secio.md."
			(at 0 0 0)
